{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-SH-CASE-F1-2026-000007", "doc_id": "SH-CASE-F1-2026", "statement": "- Baiyin Road (from Linze Road to the circuit)\n- Yi'ning Road (from Yunping Road to the circuit, and from Donghuan Road to the circuit)\n- Anchen Road (from Bao'an Highway to the circuit, and from south of the Bao'an Highway overpass to the circuit)\n- Anxiao Road (from Bao'an Highway to the circuit, and from south of the Bao'an Highway overpass to the circuit)\n- East Yuanguo Road (from Youju Road to the circuit)\nDuring the event, all F1 parking lots require a valid permit. Vehicles without a permit will not be allowed into the restricted areas.", "knowledge_type": "measure", "normative_force": "experience", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": [], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "SH-CASE-F1-2026@para-0007", "pdf_page": null, "printed_page": null, "source_unit": "SH-CASE-F1-2026@src-0001", "line_start": 1, "line_end": 34}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
